[RUN] The sealed primary is the repository `AdamMLPHead`, evaluated with the
declared `AdamSetInteractionHead` hard-zero semantics: hidden `(64,64)`, ReLU,
learning rate `1.0e-3`, Adam betas `(0.9,0.999)`, epsilon `1e-8`, zero weight
decay, loss weight 1, 2,000 deterministic full-batch epochs, and no early
selection. The diagnostic creates the standalone C3 network directly from each
fold seed, matching C1REAL's diagnostic initialization convention; it does not
advance a production orchestrator RNG through C1 and C2 initializations.

[RUN] Level `R²` is pooled on raw held-out `Psi_A/kappa` values with no
test-time re-gauging. Pairwise ordering uses all non-tied true candidate pairs
within an anchor, truth ties within `1e-12` excluded and prediction ties within
`1e-15` worth 0.5. Top-1 uses stable predicted argmax and credits any true

